Sales Performance Analysis
Industry: Retail and E-commerce
Business scenario
A retail business wants to understand its sales performance across time, products, and countries to identify growth opportunities and investigate cancellations and returns.

Business objectives
- Identify monthly sales trends and growth patterns.
- Find top-performing products and countries.
- Analyze order volume and average order value.
- Investigate cancellations, returns, and data-quality issues.
- Develop actionable recommendations for business decision-makers.

